        <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="de">Olst</skos:prefLabel>
        <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Olst, a former municipality, now the municipality of Olst-Wijhe in Overijssel, where emergency paper money of 0.10, 0.25, 1.00, and 10.00 guilders were designed at the beginning of World War II, but were never issued.</skos:definition>
        <dcterms:source rdf:resource="https://wiki.muntenenpapiergeld.nl/index.php?title=Papiergeldplaatsen"/>
